cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use UMDB, please cite it as below and state the date or commit of the
  release you used, since the catalog is updated continuously.
title: "UMDB: Urban Microbiome Database"
abstract: >-
  An openly accessible, continuously updated index of public urban environmental
  sequencing metadata (NCBI SRA runs with BioSample and BioProject context),
  with harmonized geographic and assay annotations and AI-assisted metadata review.
type: software
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Lucaci
    given-names: Alexander G.
repository-code: "https://github.com/aglucaci/UMDB"
url: "https://aglucaci.github.io/UMDB/"
keywords:
  - urban microbiome
  - metagenomics
  - built environment
  - wastewater surveillance
  - metadata harmonization
  - NCBI SRA
